{"unit_id":"yhPrime__dsh-exp-lib-provider#card-zh","repo":"yhPrime/dsh-exp-lib-provider","commit":"c93f56ae989ecffe8975043d7c197cb51440d00d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-exp-lib-provider 是 DSH 的经验记忆空间 Provider，也注册经验记录、召回和类型管理工具。它把做法与结果保存在本地 JSON 文件中，使用相似经验和 JitRL 优势评分排序，并可按类型形成簇、路由任务和生成简报。用户可记录成功、失败或被纠正的做法，检索相似任务经验、管理经验类型，并在每轮提示中查看类型目录。适合希望让 DSH 在后续同类任务中参考本地工作经验的用户；无需 API 密钥，需安装 dsh-mnemon 记忆插件。","source":"generated","evidence":["provider.js:52-65","tools.js:17-34","tools.js:53-69","plugin.js:29-38"]}
{"unit_id":"yhPrime__dsh-exp-lib-provider#card-en","repo":"yhPrime/dsh-exp-lib-provider","commit":"c93f56ae989ecffe8975043d7c197cb51440d00d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-exp-lib-provider adds a local experience memory provider and tools to record outcomes, recall similar approaches, and manage types. It ranks examples with JitRL and can route by type clusters. No API key is needed; dsh-mnemon is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["provider.js:52-65","tools.js:17-34","tools.js:53-69","plugin.js:29-38"]}
