{"unit_id":"yhPrime__dsh-exp-lib-provider#feature-record","repo":"yhPrime/dsh-exp-lib-provider","commit":"c93f56ae989ecffe8975043d7c197cb51440d00d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-exp-lib-provider 的功能「经验记录」：模型调用 exp_record 提交任务意图、做法和结果，可附类型与备注；重复做法会更新记录，近似替换会保留新旧关系。","source":"generated","evidence":["tools.js:17-50","store.js:286-390"]}
